# hui BEAM VARIANTS — 236+LP, 236+LK, 236+2P(ES) in one run (14z-70h).
#
# WHY: the scope asked whether the maintainer's three beams are ONE
# effect machine or several. That is a CODE question — it cannot be
# answered from the screen, and asking him to judge it visually was the
# wrong question. This rig answers it by measurement: run all three
# variants, put an execution breakpoint on each vs2-only machine entry
# (0x0934A8 and 0x0937AE) on the NATIVE leg, and see which fires when.
#
# ES NEEDS METER. 236+2P with an empty meter is silently DOWNGRADED to
# the normal special — the same trap that made three sessions think Dark
# Force was firing when it was not (14z-69). Stocks are poked at $FF8509
# (P1 +0x109, the documented ES-scripting poke) and the verdict must
# assert the ES actually came out, not that the buttons were pressed.
#
# BOTH SIDES POKED: P1 = Huitzil 0x10, P2 = Victor 0x03 on both games.
# POKES="1400:ff8782:10;1450:ff8782:10;1500:ff8782:10;1400:ff8b82:03;1450:ff8b82:03;1500:ff8b82:03;3100:ff8509:03;3400:ff8509:03;3700:ff8509:03"
300-305 sys=C1
420-425 sys=C2
800-803 sys=S1
940-943 sys=S2
1100-1102 p2=R
1160-1162 p2=R
1300-1302 p1=1
1360-1362 p2=1
# ── 236 + LP  (the plain beam)
3150-3152 p1=D
3153-3155 p1=DR
3156-3158 p1=R1
# ── 236 + LK  (the LOW beam — hits crouching)
3450-3452 p1=D
3453-3455 p1=DR
3456-3458 p1=R4
# ── 236 + 2P  (the ES beam — girthier, different Phobos shape)
3750-3752 p1=D
3753-3755 p1=DR
3756-3758 p1=R12
3950 wait
